{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id1281265418"}, "name":{"label":"drupset"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2021-07-15T22:18:04-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.7.2"}, "id":{"label":"7581805500"}, "title":{"label":"Lack of floors"}, "content":{"label":"The steps are very accurate \nThe floors are a joke.\nI have walked up and down stairs all day long and wound up with zero floors. And this after 20,000 steps. There is no way anyone could get the mountain climber award. I might do it at the mall one day just out of spite and I mean by going up and down the long escalator for an hour. It seems that is the only thing that gives you any floors \n\nWell, I just went up 4 flights of stairs and didn’t get a single floor recorded. What’s the point of going up stairs if you hardly ever see floors recorded on the app? No one will ever get a 100 floors if the only way to get any is by going up a long escalator at the mall. Seriously, it’s a travesty", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=712286167&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
